<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CSS Layout Debugging</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
    background:#f4f4f4;
    line-height:1.6;
}

/* Header */
header{
    background:#2c3e50;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}

/* Navigation */
nav{
    background:#34495e;
}

nav ul{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    list-style:none;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

nav ul li{
    margin:15px;
}

nav ul li a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:bold;
}

nav ul li a:hover{
    color:yellow;
}

/* Main Layout */
.container{
    display:flex;
    gap:20px;
    padding:20px;
}

/* Content */
.content{
    flex:3;
    background:white;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

.content h2{
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.cards{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:20px;
    margin-top:20px;
}

.card{
    flex:1;
    min-width:200px;
    background:#eaf4ff;
    padding:15px;
    border-radius:8px;
    text-align:center;
}

/* Sidebar */
.sidebar{
    flex:1;
    background:white;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

.sidebar h3{
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.sidebar ul{
    list-style:none;
}

.sidebar li{
    padding:10px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;
}

/* Footer */
footer{
    background:#2c3e50;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:15px;
    margin-top:20px;
}

/* Tablet View */
@media(max-width:768px){

.container{
    flex-direction:column;
}

.cards{
    justify-content:center;
}

}

/* Mobile View */
@media(max-width:480px){

nav ul{
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
}

header h1{
    font-size:24px;
}

.container{
    padding:10px;
}

.card{
    min-width:100%;
}

}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>CSS Layout Debugging</h1>
</header>

<nav>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Gallery</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>

<div class="container">

    <section class="content">

        <h2>Main Content</h2>

        <p>
            This webpage demonstrates a responsive layout using CSS Flexbox.
            The layout automatically adjusts to different screen sizes,
            preventing overlapping and maintaining proper alignment.
        </p>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Section 1</h3>
                <p>Responsive layout using Flexbox.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Section 2</h3>
                <p>Proper spacing and alignment.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Section 3</h3>
                <p>No overlapping during resizing.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <aside class="sidebar">

        <h3>Quick Links</h3>

        <ul>
            <li>HTML Tutorial</li>
            <li>CSS Flexbox</li>
            <li>CSS Grid</li>
            <li>Media Queries</li>
            <li>Responsive Design</li>
        </ul>

    </aside>

</div>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 CSS Layout Debugging. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
